this is the workaround people can use who really need this pattern:


    class A(..):
        myChildrenA = relationship(...)

       @property
       def myChildren(self):
            return myChildrenA

    class B(..):
        myChildrenB = relationship(...)

       @property
       def myChildren(self):
            return myChildrenB
